{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 38,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, don’t rebuke me in your wrath, me in your hot displeasure.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你不要在怒中责备我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你不要在怒中責備我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "For your arrows have pierced me, your hand presses hard on me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为，你的箭射入我身；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為，你的箭射入我身；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "There is no soundness in my flesh because of your indignation, is there any health in my bones because of my sin.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因你的恼怒，我的肉无一完全；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因你的惱怒，我的肉無一完全；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "For my iniquities have gone over my head. As a heavy burden, they are too heavy for me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的罪孽高过我的头，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的罪孽高過我的頭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "My wounds are loathsome and corrupt because of my foolishness.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因我的愚昧，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因我的愚昧，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "I am in pain and bowed down greatly. I go mourning all day long.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我疼痛，大大拳曲，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我疼痛，大大拳曲，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "For my waist is filled with burning. There is no soundness in my flesh.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我满腰是火；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我滿腰是火；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "I am faint and severely bruised. I have groaned by reason of the anguish of my heart.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我被压伤，身体疲倦；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我被壓傷，身體疲倦；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "Lord, all my desire is before you. My groaning is not hidden from you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "主啊，我的心愿都在你面前；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "主啊，我的心願都在你面前；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "My heart throbs. My strength fails me. As for the light of my eyes, it has also left me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我心跳动，我力衰微，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我心跳動，我力衰微，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my plague. My kinsmen stand far away.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的良朋密友因我的灾病都躲在旁边站着；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的良朋密友因我的災病都躲在旁邊站着；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "They also who seek after my life lay snares. who seek my hurt speak mischievous things, and meditate deceits all day long.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那寻索我命的设下网罗；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那尋索我命的設下網羅；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "But I, as a deaf man, don’t hear. I am as a mute man who doesn’t open his mouth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但我如聋子不听，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但我如聾子不聽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "Yes, I am as a man who doesn’t hear, in whose mouth are no reproofs.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我如不听见的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我如不聽見的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "For I hope in you, LORD. You will answer, Lord my God.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，我仰望你！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，我仰望你！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "For I said, “Don’t let them gloat over me, or exalt themselves over me when my foot slips.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我曾说：恐怕他们向我夸耀；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我曾說：恐怕他們向我誇耀；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "For I am ready to fall. My pain is continually before me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我几乎跌倒；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我幾乎跌倒；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "For I will declare my iniquity. I will be sorry for my sin.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要承认我的罪孽；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要承認我的罪孽；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "But my enemies are vigorous and many. Those who hate me without reason are numerous.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但我的仇敌又活泼又强壮，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但我的仇敵又活潑又強壯，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "20",
      "en": {
        "text": "They who give evil for good are also adversaries to me, is good.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "以恶报善的与我作对，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "以惡報善的與我作對，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "21",
      "en": {
        "text": "Don’t forsake me, LORD. My God, don’t be far from me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你不要撇弃我！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你不要撇棄我！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "22",
      "en": {
        "text": "Hurry to help me, Lord, my salvation.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "拯救我的主啊，求你快快帮助我！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "拯救我的主啊，求你快快幫助我！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}